Task 2.1 – Model the Events (2 Marks)
The appointment window uses Swing components. When the receptionist interacts with a component, an event is generated and the registered listener handles it.
Event source	Event object	Listener interface	Action performed
Patient ID text field	KeyEvent	KeyListener	Accept patient ID input
Department combo box	ActionEvent	ActionListener	Refresh the doctor list
Doctor combo box	ActionEvent	ActionListener	Select a doctor
Time slot combo box	ActionEvent	ActionListener	Select appointment time
Book button	ActionEvent	ActionListener	Validate and book appointment
Clear button	ActionEvent	ActionListener	Clear all input fields
Window close button	WindowEvent	WindowListener	Ask for confirmation before closing

Important: A text field can also be validated when the Book button is clicked. A KeyListener is not compulsory for normal patient ID validation.
